;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt; 当社子会社の執行役員　５&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt; 当社子会社の従業員　157&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
